{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/ggang.gif?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot; So I came to smash everything.    </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not to leave a single piece of dust behind. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>The time when humans gave up being happy to be no longer unhappy and became 'bugs'. <br> The story of a witch who smashes everything with a baseball bat tightly in her hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/line.png?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;KILL THE WITCH&quot; is a hardcore 2D action platformer game. <br>You have to fight with only your own skills and willpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/features_2.png?t=1741074781\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore gameplay that will fulfill your need for challenge</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters with their own personalities and charms that will win your heart</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original graphics and soundtrack that will delight your eyes and ears</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/developer_2.png?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game takes a lot of inspiration from other titles such as OFF,  Cave Story, Momodora and Touhou Project. <br>But at the same time, I think it also captures some of my own things that I want to express. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks as always. <br>I hope you enjoy it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/shorts.gif?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Director : ASO<br>Develop : ASO, HongRyeol <br>Art : ASO, Kong Ji Hyeon<br>Soundtrack : Misty</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2878760?t=1741074781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741074781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/55f4eb5970b7de4e5e06f44d4f112628ca4be000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741074781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/55f4eb5970b7de4e5e06f44d4f112628ca4be000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741074781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2879290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Guide to creating and streaming game content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel free to stream it, post it on YouTube~!<br><br>If you have any other requests or questions, please feel free to contact us :)<br><a href=\"mailto:boss@snakeeagle.com\">boss@snakeeagle.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/ggang.gif?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot; So I came to smash everything.    </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Not to leave a single piece of dust behind. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>The time when humans gave up being happy to be no longer unhappy and became 'bugs'. <br> The story of a witch who smashes everything with a baseball bat tightly in her hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/line.png?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;KILL THE WITCH&quot; is a hardcore 2D action platformer game. <br>You have to fight with only your own skills and willpower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/features_2.png?t=1741074781\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore gameplay that will fulfill your need for challenge</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters with their own personalities and charms that will win your heart</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original graphics and soundtrack that will delight your eyes and ears</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/developer_2.png?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game takes a lot of inspiration from other titles such as OFF,  Cave Story, Momodora and Touhou Project. <br>But at the same time, I think it also captures some of my own things that I want to express. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks as always. <br>I hope you enjoy it :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/shorts.gif?t=1741074781\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Director : ASO<br>Develop : ASO, HongRyeol <br>Art : ASO, Kong Ji Hyeon<br>Soundtrack : Misty</p>","developers":["SnakeEagle"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/header.jpg?t=1741074781","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109580,"mp4":{